# Closing a window (Phase 3, step 5): closing one of two windows shuts down
# its Maxima while the other window's keeps running. (The save sheet of an
# edited worksheet is out of process; the XCUITests press its buttons.)
wait 3
type 1+1;
key n cmd
wait 4
procs .build/keyscripts/close-1.txt
key w cmd
wait 3
procs .build/keyscripts/close-2.txt
dump .build/keyscripts/close-3.json
quit
